    "claim": "check_security's group loop passes when the library readers contain 'anonymous' OR the caller's group, so library=anonymous plus per-command groups is the fine-grained convention; check_auth (app.read/write/delete and app.exec-by-id) has NO anonymous pass-through - the group must appear in BOTH the library readers and the record readers, so group-gating a control's records for non-admin readers also requires that group at the library level.",
